      <xs:documentation>Agency/ Agent Identification Type. {codeListAgencyName}PADIS{/codeListAgencyName} {codeListName}Identification type{/codeListName} {codeListIdentifier}9893{/codeListIdentifier} </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
